First open your session. Then click on the little icon in the top left
corner of the PuTTY window. You'll be presented with a menu containing
a Full Screen option.

In order to leave full-screen mode, you click on the top left corner
of the screen to get the same menu (took me a while to figure that bit
out) and deselect Full Screen.

I don't know if there is a way to make PuTTY always start a session in
full-screen mode. I'm pretty sure there isn't one.

